  "story": {
    "day": 91,
    "title": "Kaya's Thursday Visit",
    "sentences": [
      "Last Thursday, Kaya wore her favorite jeans.",
      "She visited her grandfather's place, two kilometers along the lake.",
      "First, they ate fish from a clean plate.",
      "Kaya had a computer problem; a key was missing.",
      "\"Whose sock is this by the door?\" she asked, holding a towel.",
      "She used his computer to turn it on and read.",
      "It told of a religious custom and an island's battle.",
      "A god from the fourth, twelfth, and thirteenth centuries watched.",
      "Kaya saw a firefighter and a police officer drawn there.",
      "\"Let's go straight to the mall for a shoe sale,\" he said.",
      "\"We will pay for a Christmas gift; that change helps your headache.\"",
      "Grandfather offered her a cup of tea."
    ]
  }
}